s \\\"Ingredients\\\", \\\"Directions For Use\\\", and \\\"Warnings\\\" followed by dense black text detailing chemical and botanical components, application steps, and safety precautions.\",\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535495-cf3f9bf0-19ca-4cf6-90f7-f88ce9cdf577.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535537-5b7b72b0-f72e-4fd4-8dc7-55e167fe9ce1.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535471-6193e147-13dc-41cf-b09d-e1f79cb77943.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535650-1801c00f-aab6-4107-a16c-a53252d8577b.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/78371df6-ec93-4a25-abd7-c7eaeff1f406/76f7727e-de2d-47fb-bc9c-c4417db4975c.png\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535495-cf3f9bf0-19ca-4cf6-90f7-f88ce9cdf577.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535537-5b7b72b0-f72e-4fd4-8dc7-55e167fe9ce1.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535471-6193e147-13dc-41cf-b09d-e1f79cb77943.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535650-1801c00f-aab6-4107-a16c-a53252d8577b.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/78371df6-ec93-4a25-abd7-c7eaeff1f406/76f7727e-de2d-47fb-bc9c-c4417db4975c.png\"]},\"performanceLabels\":{},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:56:45.091Z\",\"versions\":[{\"id\":\"5d7e54c0-9941-4225-aca2-9e04151c0674\",\"creativeId\":\"7aa49902-d370-4c09-a4db-6de18c998c6d\",\"versionNumber\":1,\"parentVersionId\":null,\"generationJobId\":\"7b0188bc-9192-43c2-91f2-d0dcf07e13fa\",\"triggerRunId\":null,\"changeTyp