ctangular block contains the text \\\"Salicylic Acid (BHA) + Succinic Acid + Multi-fruit anti-acne complex + Allantoin\\\" in small black sans-serif font. The side panels of the box and back of the bottle display detailed product information, featuring light green section headers such as \\\"Ingredients\\\", \\\"Directions For Use\\\", and \\\"Warnings\\\" followed by dense black text detailing chemical and botanical components, application steps, and safety precautions.\",\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535495-cf3f9bf0-19ca-4cf6-90f7-f88ce9cdf577.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535537-5b7b72b0-f72e-4fd4-8dc7-55e167fe9ce1.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535471-6193e147-13dc-41cf-b09d-e1f79cb77943.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535650-1801c00f-aab6-4107-a16c-a53252d8577b.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/78371df6-ec93-4a25-abd7-c7eaeff1f406/76f7727e-de2d-47fb-bc9c-c4417db4975c.png\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535495-cf3f9bf0-19ca-4cf6-90f7-f88ce9cdf577.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535537-5b7b72b0-f72e-4fd4-8dc7-55e167fe9ce1.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535471-6193e147-13dc-41cf-b09d-e1f79cb77943.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535650-1801c00f-aab6-4107-a16c-a53252d8577b.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/78371df6-ec93-4a25-abd7-c7eaeff1f406/76f7727e-de2d-47fb-bc9c-c4417db4975c.png\"]},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:56:45.091Z\"}]}],\"offeringKind\":\"physical\",\"offeringProductImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535495-cf3f9bf0-19ca-4cf6-90f7-f88ce9cdf577.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535537-5b7b72b0-f72e-4fd4-8dc7-55e167fe9ce1.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535471-6193e147-13dc-41cf-b09d-e1f79cb77943.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535650-1801c00f-aab6-4107-a16c-a53252d8577b.png\"],\"currentVersion\":{\"id\":\"a304013e-1222-444c-bba4-ccc90358e78b\",\"creativeId\":\"60e3ee3a-ea6c-4a05-9806-e1be92960071\",\"versionNumber\":1,\"parentVersionId\":null,\"generationJobId\":\"7b0188bc-9192-43c2-91f2-d0dcf07e13fa\",\"triggerRunId\":null,\"changeType\":\"initial\",\"instructions\":null,\"finalImagePrompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Ground this ad in the Objection-Rebuttal framework to tackle the fear that a gentle cleanser won't be effective against stubborn breakouts. The visual layout is a clean, sharp-edged comparative T-chart on a pure white background. The left column lists 'Other Acne Washes' highlighting drawbacks like 'Stripping pH' and 'Dry Flakes', while the right column lists 'sniQue Microfoam' showcasing 'Barrier-Safe BHA' and 'Allantoin Soothing', next to a crisp shot of the green-and-white sniQue product box. A clean 4.7-star rating badge is placed elegantly next to the box. The visual hero is the easy-to-read comparative data table. The short on-image headline is 'Strong on acne, gentle on skin.' The call to action is 'Try it today'. To keep the ad on-brand, use Jost sans-serif typography, ensure all table borders and text boxes have sharp corners with a zero-pixel radius, keep the layout compressed and highly structured, and use Review Teal (#108474) exclusively for the star rating.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This skincare product set consists of a 150 mL cylindrical foaming face wash bottle and its matching tall, rectangular cardboard outer box, both featuring a clean, minimalist white-and-light-green color palette. The bottle is made of smooth white plastic, capped with a large white foaming pump dispenser nozzle and covered by a clear, translucent cylindrical plastic cap. The bottle's main body is wrapped in a matte white label with a solid light green band at the base, matching the graphics on the rectangular box. On the front of both the bottle and the box, the upper left side displays bold, black sans-serif text reading \\\"Anti-Acne\\\", \\\"Foam Face\\\", and \\\"Wash\\\", followed by the description \\\"Foam That Fights Acne – Gently & Effectively\\\" and a list of benefits (\\\"Clear Skin\\\", \\\"Zero Oil\\\", \\\"Gentle Foam Purity\\\") separated by a thin, horizontal green line. The brand name \\\"sniQue\\\" is printed vertically on the right in a large, stylized, rounded light green lowercase font. At the very bottom, set inside the light green band, a rounded-corner rectangular block contains the text \\\"Salicylic Acid (BHA) + Succinic Acid + Multi-fruit anti-acne complex + Allantoin\\\" in small black sans-serif font. The side panels of the box and back of the bottle display detailed product information, featuring light green section headers such as \\\"Ingredients\\\", \\\"Directions For Use\\\", and \\\"Warnings\\\" followed by dense black text detailing chemical and botanical components, application steps, and safety precautions.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nThe final attached image is the official brand logo. Add it once, subtly, in clean negative space; keep it exact, legible, and uncropped.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"status\":\"generated\",\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"metadata\":{\"brief\":\"Ground this ad in the Objection-Rebuttal framework to tackle the fear that a gentle cleanser won't be effective against stubborn breakouts. The visual layout is a clean, sharp-edged comparative T-chart on a pure white background. The left column lists 'Other Acne Washes' highlighting drawbacks like 'Stripping pH' and 'Dry Flakes', while the right column lists 'sniQue Microfoam' showcasing 'Barrier-Safe BHA' and 'Allantoin Soothing', next to a crisp shot of the green-and-white sniQue product box. A clean 4.7-star rating badge is placed elegantly next to the box. The visual hero is the easy-to-read comparative data table. The short on-image headline is 'Strong on acne, gentle on skin.' The call to action is 'Try it today'. To keep the ad on-brand, use Jost sans-serif typography, ensure all table borders and text boxes have sharp corners with a zero-pixel radius, keep the layout compressed and highly structured, and use Review Teal (#108474) exclusively for the star rating.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Ground this ad in the Objection-Rebuttal framework to tackle the fear that a gentle cleanser won't be effective against stubborn breakouts. The visual layout is a clean, sharp-edged comparative T-chart on a pure white background. The left column lists 'Other Acne Washes' highlighting drawbacks like 'Stripping pH' and 'Dry Flakes', while the right column lists 'sniQue Microfoam' showcasing 'Barrier-Safe BHA' and 'Allantoin Soothing', next to a crisp shot of the green-and-white sniQue product box. A clean 4.7-star rating badge is placed elegantly next to the box. The visual hero is the easy-to-read comparative data table. The short on-image headline is 'Strong on acne, gentle on skin.' The call to action is 'Try it today'. To keep the ad on-brand, use Jost sans-serif typography, ensure all table borders and text boxes have sharp corners with a zero-pixel radius, keep the layout compressed and highly structured, and use Review Teal (#108474) exclusively for the star rating.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This skincare product set consists of a 150 mL cylindrical foaming face wash bottle and its matching tall, rectangular cardboard outer box, both featuring a clean, minimalist white-and-light-green color palette. The bottle is made of smooth white plastic, capped with a large white foaming pump dispenser nozzle and covered by a clear, translucent cylindrical plastic cap. The bottle's main body is wrapped in a matte white label with a solid light green band at the base, matching the graphics on the rectangular box. On the front of both the bottle and the box, the upper left side displays bold, black sans-serif text reading \\\"Anti-Acne\\\", \\\"Foam Face\\\", and \\\"Wash\\\", followed by the description \\\"Foam That Fights Acne – Gently & Effectively\